If it still fails on bitcode, find where those files live and what the daily package sees that yours doesn't:

bash
ls /data/ci_env/daily/pkg/compiler/tools/bishengir/
find /data/ci_env/daily/pkg -name "*.bc" 2>/dev/null | head -20
env | grep -i "bisheng\|ascend\|cann"

Bitcode is usually looked up relative to the binary, in a sibling lib directory. Your pkg-bin copied only bin/, so if the layout is bishengir/bin and bishengir/lib, the relative path from pkg-bin breaks.

If that's the case, mirror the parent instead:

bash
mkdir -p /home/yaolu/pkg
cp -r /data/ci_env/daily/pkg/compiler/tools/bishengir/. /home/yaolu/pkg/
cp /home/yaolu/bin/bishengir-compile /home/yaolu/pkg/bin/
export PATH=/home/yaolu/pkg/bin:$PATH
export BISHENG_INSTALL_PATH=/home/yaolu/pkg/bin
